{"cause":"The trusted custom-capability gateway did not independently enforce the high-risk experimental grant and profile identity, and a post-spawn result handoff failure had no public fencing path.","cause_status":"known","event_id":"f0b7d3a1-0b3d-4cc4-ae3f-2b1c6d2f7a90","event_sha256":"3c00abdcf6aac0a54f64db83d8c507aa329cc203039a89420bce533a7bffb76e","evidence":{"kind":"focused_tests","observed_at":"2026-07-27T15:40:00.000Z","ref":"tests/test_capability_notebook_materialization.py and tests/test_capability_execution_receipt.py","sha256":"b444164c97345189cfb7ac5d1a700a85e91a46c987ffbd4b5dbda9cf085a75df"},"impact":"A server wiring error could otherwise route a non-experimental grant into local custom execution or leave a unique attempt ambiguous after spawn.","incident_id":"c5b8b43e-1a9e-4d0e-9d3f-7d8f5f4e1a28","lesson":"Repeat high-risk experimental grant and profile checks at the last trusted gateway boundary, and fence post-spawn uncertainty without retry.","lesson_key":"experimental-gateway-boundary","links":["backend/workbench/capability_factory/notebook_bridge.py","backend/workbench/capability_factory/execution_receipt.py","tests/test_capability_notebook_materialization.py","tests/test_capability_execution_receipt.py"],"prev_event_sha256":"2d9fa60391e6812a9677fb3a559268755c6f30b78542c33dc2765100f5e84436","preventability":"preventable","resolution":"resolved","schema_version":1,"stage":"review","subtype":"experimental_gateway_boundary_hardened","timestamp":"2026-07-27T15:40:00.000Z","type":"REVIEW"}
